# 11. Diagnostic Provider Protocol

```swift
protocol AuraDiagnosticsProvider: Sendable {
    var providerID: DiagnosticProviderID { get }
    var supportedTests: Set<DiagnosticTestKind> { get }

    func snapshot() async -> DiagnosticProviderSnapshot
    func run(_ test: DiagnosticTestRequest) async -> DiagnosticTestResult
    func recoveryActions(for issue: DiagnosticIssue) async -> [RecoveryAction]
}
```

Provider snapshots should be lightweight and safe to request repeatedly.

Long-running tests must be explicit, cancellable and progress-aware.

