# 17. Overall Health Summary

Suggested states:

## Healthy

Title: `Everything looks good`

Body: `Aura can reach your connected services and no current problems need attention.`

## Degraded

Title: `Some features are limited`

Body: `Most of Aura is working, but one or more devices are unavailable.`

## Recovering

Title: `Aura is reconnecting`

Body: `A temporary connection problem was detected. Aura is trying to restore it.`

## Unavailable

Title: `Some devices cannot be reached`

Body: `Check that your iPhone is connected to the same Wi-Fi network as your devices.`

## Restricted

Title: `Permission required`

Body: `Aura needs access to your local network or Apple Home to continue.`

