# 22. Recovery Model

```swift
enum RecoveryActionKind: Sendable, Equatable {
    case retry
    case reconnect
    case rediscover
    case refreshAuthorization
    case openSettings
    case reauthenticate
    case refreshCapabilities
    case restartIntegration
    case openHelp
    case exportDiagnostics
}
```

```swift
struct RecoveryAction: Sendable, Identifiable {
    let id: UUID
    let title: String
    let explanation: String?
