# 30. Structured Logging

Use structured fields instead of unbounded string messages.

Example:

```swift
logger.notice(
    "Device command failed",
    metadata: [
        "plugin": .string(pluginID.rawValue),
        "command": .string(command.kind.rawValue),
        "correlation": .string(correlationID.uuidString),
        "error_code": .string(normalizedCode.rawValue)
    ]
)
```

Never log:

- Passwords
- Pairing keys
- Authorization headers
- HomeKit setup codes
- Full raw device responses
- Camera URLs containing credentials
- Unredacted private identifiers

