# 31. Exported Diagnostic Report

Export is always user initiated.

A sanitized package may include:

```text
Aura-Diagnostics/
├── summary.txt
├── app-environment.json
├── integration-health.json
├── recent-events.json
├── scene-reports.json
├── automation-reports.json
└── privacy-manifest.txt
```

The package must not include secrets.

Before export, Aura should show a clear summary of included categories.

