# 32. Redaction

Redaction rules must be centralized.

```swift
protocol DiagnosticRedacting: Sendable {
    func redact(_ report: DiagnosticReport) -> RedactedDiagnosticReport
}
```

Redact or pseudonymize:

- IP addresses
- MAC addresses
- Serial numbers
- Bridge identifiers
- Accessory identifiers
- Home names
- Room names
- Device names
- User-generated scene names where appropriate

Stable pseudonyms may be used within one report so related events remain understandable.

