# 33. Privacy Levels

Suggested export levels:

## Standard

Maximum privacy.

Includes:

- General health
- Sanitized codes
- Timing
- Integration categories
- Recovery outcomes

## Detailed

Requires explicit confirmation.

May include:

- Pseudonymized device-level relationships
- Firmware versions
- Capability lists
- More detailed execution reports

No export level may include credentials.

