# 41. Interaction and Motion

Diagnostics should feel calm.

Use:

- Progressive disclosure
- Inline progress
- Subtle status transitions
- One-time success or error haptics for user-initiated tests
- No repeated shaking, flashing or alarm-like animation

Automatic background health changes should not trigger haptics.

