# 42. Accessibility

Diagnostics must:

- Support VoiceOver
- Announce test completion
- Preserve focus when results update
- Explain health without relying on color
- Support Dynamic Type
- Respect Reduce Motion
- Provide meaningful button labels
- Expose test progress textually
- Avoid rapidly changing live regions

Example:

